{"id":"p0dkuh5btzm9feu39ws529coa","title":"鲑鱼捕捞的历史记录揭示了人类与海洋生物的长期互动","originalTitle":"Hooked on Tuna","summary":"人类对鲑鱼的捕捞历史可追溯至44000年前，从东帝汶到地中海，鲑鱼不仅是食物来源，也是文化象征。考古发现显示，早在10000年前，日本和韩国已有丰富的鲑鱼捕捞和烹饪传统。地中海的蓝鳍鲑鱼商业渔场早在3000年前就已形成，而北美西北海岸的原住民在5000多年前就开始捕捞太平洋蓝鳍鲑鱼。这些发现揭示了人类与海洋生物的长期互动历史。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://theconversation.com/hooked-on-tuna-people-have-been-harvesting-these-ocean-predators-for-44-000-years-292428"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T02:23:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T05:28:18.438Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T05:28:18.438Z","category":null,"tags":["教程与观点"],"score":15,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}